dium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"612\" bgcolor=\"#ccffcc\" height=\"172\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23.2pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">◇ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">7.1일 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">한‧EU FTA 발효와 최근 한‧미 FTA 비준안 상정 예정 등에 따라</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">, 대학사회 내의 FTA에 대한 관심 및 이해도</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">제고를 위해 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.5pt\">기획재정부 무역협정국내대책본부가 ‘한‧미 FTA 에세이 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">공모전’을 개최</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.5pt\">합니다.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt\"> 이번 공모전에 FTA 시대를 살아가는 국내외 대학(원)생들의</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\"> 많은 관심과 참여를 바랍니다.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"> </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 126%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 126%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">1. 응모자격</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">□ ‘11.6월 현재 국내외 대학(원)에 재학‧휴학 중인 학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;ㅇ 개인 또는 팀 단위(3인 이내)로 응모 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;- 팀 단위로 응모할 경우, 참가자 모두 응모자격을 충족해야 함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">2. 에세이 주제</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">□ 대주제: 한‧미 FTA로 달라지는 우리 생활</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;①</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\"> 달라지는 고용환경</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* (예시) 한‧미 FTA 발효로 달라질 나의 취업전략</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">② 달라지는 소비환경</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* (예시) 한‧미 FTA 발효로 달라질 장바구니물가와 쇼핑 노하우</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;③</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> 달라지는 중소기업환경</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* (예시) 한‧미 FTA 시대에 내가 꿈꾸는 수출입 성공기</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">④ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">한‧미 FTA로 달라지는 우리나라 위상 체험기 또는 가상의 사례</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* (예시) 외국 여행 중 외국인이 먼저 알아본 우리 위상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 135%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; FONT-FAMIL